menu "C5VRX receiver"

    config C5VRX_VIDEO_OUTPUT
        bool "Drive the 6-bit video DAC (GPIO 23, 24, 11, 12, 8, 9)"
        default y
        help
            Off: the transport (PARLIO TX, BitScrambler) runs unchanged, at the
            same timing, but its bits reach no pin: no picture. The IQ capture
            (MODEM_DIAG -> PARLIO RX) and everything measured from it (C/N,
            gain, FIELD_DIAG) are unaffected. The six DAC pins become free (the
            detector's UART link uses GPIO 8). This fork has no on-screen menu,
            OSD or boot logo either way (menu_stub.c).

endmenu
